=====================

 S~S  Release notes version 260105: template-docs repository activity: create the repository

------------------------------------------

    Instantiate the repository version control database from file system version control database.

    This collection of human metadata files were instantiated into the .\template-docs directory.
    All of the files except LICENSE were created from scratch by TSC LLC for SimpleSal repos.

        .\README                    an introduction, a window, a sales pitch about the content
        .\FUTURES                   a hallucination, a dream, customer demand about the content
        .\RELEASE                   instantaneous description of a release of content at Time X
        .\CHANGELOG                 cumulative RELEASE descrptions at Time X, Y, Z

        .\LICENSE                   as emitted by GitHub license Application: GPL 3.0 selected
        .\LICENSE-TSC-LLC           an interpretation of what TSC LLC wants the license to be
        .\COPYING                   a clear statement that copying and using needs no license

        .\master-format-example     TSC LLC view of a format

